  "summary_en": "ISO store page for ISO/PAS 8800:2024, a publicly available specification on safety and AI in series-production road vehicles. It addresses risks from output insufficiencies, systematic errors and hardware errors of AI elements, mainly machine learning, and describes properties for building safety assurance claims of absence of unreasonable risk.",
